<title>HONG KONG: Trial of China dissident Wang Dan begins - HK radio.</title>
<headline>Trial of China dissident Wang Dan begins - HK radio.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chinese dissident Wang Dan went on trial in Beijing for subversion on Wednesday, Hong Kong radio quoted a court official as saying.</p>
<p>Wang's trial began at 9.00 a.m. (0100 GMT) amid tight security with about 100 officers deployed to cordon off the court, the radio's correspondent reported.</p>
